Here is a complete, single-file Pomodoro web app. It includes the 25/5 intervals, loops 4 times, triggers the 30-minute long break on the fourth round, and even has a little alarm sound (using the browser's built-in synth) so you know when time's up.

To use this, just save the code below into a file named **`pomodoro.html`** and double-click it to open it in any web browser!

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Pomodoro Clock</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            background-color: #2b2d42;
            color: #edf2f4;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
